The following logistic regression model was used to assess the relationship between the risk of conduct problems and harsh parental discipline, with adjustment for potentially confounding parent and child factors (child sex, family socioeconomic status, financial hardship and maternal psychological distress):\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
