				\begin{document}$$ y = x $$\end{document}y=x line corresponds to the posterior predictive p-value (i.e. 0.026).Fig. 6
Posterior predictive checks of the coefficient for harsh discipline from the logistic regression analysis model. Estimates of the regression coefficient for harsh discipline from the replicated data are plotted against the estimates from the completed data (based on 2000 replications). The proportion of markers above the y = x line represents the posterior predictive p value (PPP = 0.026)
